		icon: "message" as const,
	},
];

const trustBadges = [
  {
    href: "https://www.capterra.com/p/10018264/Knockio/",
    src: asset("badge-new-capterra.webp"),
    alt: "Knockio Capterra rating badge",
    label: "View Knockio reviews on Capterra",
  },
  {
    href: "https://www.softwareadvice.com/field-sales/knockio-profile/",
    src: asset("badge-new-software-advice.webp"),
    alt: "Knockio Software Advice rating badge",
    label: "View Knockio reviews on Software Advice",
  },
  {
    href: "https://www.getapp.com/all-software/a/knockio/",
    src: asset("badge-new-get-app.webp"),
    alt: "Knockio GetApp rating badge",
    label: "View Knockio reviews on GetApp",
  },
  {
    href: "https://www.g2.com/products/knockio-by-knockio/reviews",
    src: asset("badge-new-g2.webp"),
    alt: "Knockio G2 rating badge",
    label: "View Knockio reviews on G2",
  },
];

const faqs = [
  {
    q: "What should I look for in restoration job management software?",
    a: "Look for 24/7 emergency dispatching, complete loss history per address, Direction to Pay and work authorization e-contracts, daily IICRC S500 psychrometric moisture logs, equipment barcode scanning, and flexible billing—all tied to one job record. The platform should carry both mitigation and reconstruction without forcing you into two tools. Knockio was built to run both from the same system.",
  },
  {
    q: "Can technicians log IICRC S500 psychrometric moisture readings on their phone?",
    a: "Yes. Technicians can record daily relative humidity (RH), temperature, GPP (grains per pound), and moisture meter percentage readings across affected rooms directly into the permanent loss record to satisfy insurance adjusters.",
  },
  {
    q: "Does Knockio protect my business against banned Assignment of Benefits (AOB) laws?",
    a: "Yes. In reform states like Florida (SB 2-A) where post-loss Assignment of Benefits (AOB) agreements are prohibited, Knockio automatically gates your template library—substituting legally compliant Direction to Pay forms and Contingency Agreements.",
  },
  {
    q: "Can Knockio track daily per-diem rental billing for drying equipment?",
    a: "Yes. Technicians can scan barcodes or QR codes on dehumidifiers, air movers, and HEPA scrubbers left on site. Knockio logs the exact deployment and removal dates, automating daily equipment rental counts to support your Xactimate billing.",
  },
  {
    q: "How is Knockio different from DASH, Encircle, or Jobber for restoration companies?",
    a: "DASH is a legacy enterprise system with complex overhead, Encircle focuses primarily on field documentation without full CRM invoicing, and Jobber lacks restoration-specific workflows like psychrometric moisture logging and Direction to Pay forms. Knockio combines 24/7 GPS dispatching, IICRC moisture logs, barcode equipment tracking, and e-contracts in one flat-rate platform.",
  },
];

const reviewsRow1 = [
  {
    name: "Lacey Jackson",
    avatar: asset("avatar-lacey-jackson.webp"),
    quote:
      "This app is the best thing that has happened to our company! Asad is absolutely amazing! He is so responsive, it doesn't matter what time of day he is on it! I highly recommend this company add this app!",
